# pos-api pre-push verify

When any change under `pos-api/` will be committed or pushed:

1. Use **Java 21** (not the default Windows Java 8). Example:
   `$env:JAVA_HOME = "C:\Users\ai_sh\.jdks\jdk-21.0.12.1+1"`
2. From `pos-api/`, run `mvn -B clean verify` and wait for exit 0.
3. Do not push if verify fails. Do not rely on Dokploy to discover compile/test errors.
4. Keep new/changed tests green in the **same** commit as the implementation.
5. Full rules and failure checklist: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) § “pos-api pre-push gate (Dokploy)”.
